sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant App as Next.js
    participant Stripe as Stripe
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Email as Brevo

    Note over U,Email: New Subscription
    U->>App: POST /api/billing/checkout (priceId)
    App->>Stripe: Create Checkout Session
    Stripe-->>App: Session URL
    App-->>U: Redirect to Stripe Checkout
    U->>Stripe: Enter payment + submit
    Stripe->>App: Webhook: checkout.session.completed
    App->>DB: Create/Update Subscription (ACTIVE)
    App->>Email: Send welcome email
    Stripe-->>U: Redirect to /billing?success=true

    Note over U,Email: Payment Failure
    Stripe->>Stripe: Retry payment (day 3, 7, 14)
    Stripe->>App: Webhook: invoice.payment_failed
    App->>DB: Update subscription (PAST_DUE)
    App->>Email: Send payment failed email
    
    Note over U,Email: Cancellation
    U->>App: POST /api/billing/cancel
    App->>Stripe: Cancel at period end
    Stripe->>App: Webhook: customer.subscription.deleted
    App->>DB: Downgrade to FREE tier
    App->>Email: Send cancellation confirmation
